  <div class="site-footer__inner">
    <p class="site-footer__line">
      LOYFIDE™ is a brand of WAFIYA ENTERPRISES, Kurnool, Andhra Pradesh, India.
    </p>
    <p class="site-footer__copyright">© 2026 WAFIYA ENTERPRISES</p>
